  - If pipeline conversion < target for two consecutive quarters → activate headcount reductions / further cuts
  - If burn reduction target not met in 60 days → escalate to leadership for contingency plan

6) Short finance narrative (two versions — concise and expanded)  
Use as a slide title + talking points or as the opening to an internal memo.

