- Help craft the message to leadership/people (e.g., HR-friendly communications if you plan temporary pay measures or hiring freeze).

Questions for you so I can tailor materials precisely
1. Is the $62k burn net (after revenue) or gross? Do you have a recent P&L or cashflow split (payroll, marketing, R&D, G&A)?
2. Are there constraints (no layoffs, cannot reduce marketing, must avoid salary cuts)?
3. Do you want to prioritize fundraising (equity vs debt) or prefer pure cost-driven runway extension?
4. Who is the audience for the material (executive team, board, all-staff)?

