Financing options (trade-offs and timeline)
- Equity raise (best long-term, but time-consuming and dilutive)
- Convertible bridge / SAFE (faster, less immediate dilution but higher future dilution)
- Venture debt (non-dilutive initially, requires covenants and predictable revenue)
