B. Quick scenario math (impact on runway)

1) Burn-reduction scenarios (assumes burn is net cash burn)
- Baseline: Burn $62K → runway = 1,200,000 / 62,000 = ~19.4 months
- Reduce burn by 10% (to $55.8K) → runway ≈ 21.5 months (+2.1 months)
