- Finalize financing (debt or equity) if pursuing — KPI: cash raised, cost of capital

G. KPIs to include in internal materials
- Cash on hand ($)
- Net burn ($/month)
- Runway (months)
- Monthly recurring revenue (MRR) or quarterly revenue and growth %
- Contribution margin on incremental revenue
- DSO / AR balance
- CAC, LTV if relevant
- Committed savings from cost measures (signed contracts or clear estimates)

