  - Optimize go-to-market spend: focus on highest-ROI channels, pause low-return experiments
  - Consolidate/automate functions (finance, ops) to lower FTE contractor needs
  - Sublease office space, move to flexible/remote where possible
  - Reprice or package products to improve margin
