- Net burn reflects current revenue contribution; if revenue declines, burn will increase.
- Savings estimates depend on speed and scope of implementation (e.g., headcount reductions are largest but costliest in terms of company health).
- Financing terms will affect runway (debt interest, covenants); run multiple term scenarios.

