- If revenue grows 25% QoQ → revenue ≈ $279,167 → net burn ≈ $6,167 → runway ≈ 194 months (near break-even).
- If revenue grows 50% QoQ → revenue ≈ $335,000 → net burn ≈ −$49,667 (positive cash flow +$49.7k/mo).

