- Cut discretionary marketing/events/travel: $5k–$25k/mo.
- SaaS, tools, and licenses audit (eliminate unused seats / downgrade plans): $2k–$10k/mo.
- Negotiate vendor payment terms (extend payables) — improves cash flow timing (one-time relief) and can reduce near-term cash outflow.

Short term (30–90 days)
