B — Runway-extension scenarios (assume $62K net burn)
Base case
- Burn = $62,000 → runway ≈ 19.35 months

If you reduce net burn by:
- 10% (burn → $55,800): runway = 1,200,000 / 55,800 ≈ 21.5 months (+2.2 months)
- 20% (burn → $49,600): runway ≈ 24.2 months (+4.9 months)
- 30% (burn → $43,400): runway ≈ 27.6 months (+8.3 months)
