- Renegotiate vendor terms for extended payment terms or lower rates (legal, cloud, agency)
- Delay non-essential capital expenditures
- Accelerate AR collections: incentives for faster customer payment (1–2% discount for 10–15 day pay)
- Apply for available R&D / wage tax credits or grants

Medium-term (30–90 days)
- Department-by-department headcount & role review; identify consolidation and non-replacement opportunities
- Move contractors to part-time or fixed-scope engagements
- Renegotiate office lease (sublet, downsizing, remote-first pivot)
- Switch some compensation from cash to equity/RSUs for new hires or deferred bonuses
- Sales push: targeted campaigns to top customers for upsells, expansions, multi-quarter prepayments

Structural / strategic (90+ days)
- Larger workforce reductions or restructuring if necessary (plan communications and severance)
- Seek strategic partnership / customer agreements for committed annual contracts or prepayments
- Raise a bridge round (convertible note, SAFE) or revenue-based financing if equity raise timing is unfavorable
- Sell or license non-core assets / IP
- Explore sale-leaseback of physical assets, factoring of receivables

