“Quick update: we have $1.2M cash and ~20 months runway. To preserve optionality we recommend an immediate hiring freeze and vendor/SaaS review to target a 10–20% reduction in net burn within 60 days, plus prioritized revenue initiatives (annual prepay offers, enterprise upsell push). I’ll circulate a detailed plan and P&L scenarios by [date]. Please send any immediate non-critical spend you’d like paused to finance@stlab.com.”

Recommended next steps I can help with
1. Build a 12–36 month P&L & cash-flow sensitivity model (I can produce the spreadsheet) showing: baseline, 10/20/30% net-burn cuts, revenue growth scenarios, and financing options.
2. Draft the 3-slide deck and a one-page memo for Board approval.
3. Draft outreach templates for investors or lenders if you want to explore a bridge.

Questions for you so I can tailor the deliverables
