2. Do you have a target runway (e.g., 24 months minimum) or an upper bound on acceptable headcount reductions or dilution?
3. Can you share top-level expense breakdown (payroll %, marketing %, SaaS/licenses %, rent) or a P&L? That will let me size each lever more accurately.
