- Risk: revenue volatility and hiring/contractor costs could shorten runway.
- Opportunity: modest action opens large runway gains.

Slide 3 — Recommended plan (immediate + medium)
- Immediate: hiring freeze, cut discretionary spend 10%+, renegotiate vendors, accelerate collections
- Medium: prioritize sales for annual/prepaid deals, pursue bridge financing only if needed
