Slide 4 — Ask / decisions needed
- Approve immediate hiring freeze & 10% targeted discretionary cuts
- Mandate finance to structure 90-day cash forecast and present financing options if required
- Approve sales incentive program for annual prepayments

Communication tone guidance (for internal memo)
- Be factual, calm and solution-oriented.
- Emphasize runway is sufficient but proactive steps lower execution risk.
- Be transparent about trade-offs and timelines; commit to a follow-up update in 30 days with revised forecast.

Next steps I can do for you
