- Target raise size: at minimum enough to achieve 18–24 months post-close runway plus buffer for execution. Example: if you want 24 months after close and will keep burn at current $62K, raise ≈ $288K + a buffer (I’d recommend adding 20–30% buffer = raise ~$350–400K).

