- Financing plan: pursue a small bridge of $350–400K (if necessary) to reach 24 months post-close / or evaluate venture debt given revenue traction. Timeline: begin outreach in 8–10 months or sooner for leverage.
- Ask from leadership/Board: approve hiring freeze and cost-savings program; agree to 30/60/90-day review cadence; authorize management to begin financing conversations as described.

