  - 60–90d: finalize bridge facility; revisit headcount with targeted role reviews only if needed
- Target outcomes
  - Reduce burn by ~$12–20k/month; runway >30 months with bridge
- Risks & mitigations
  - Risk: slowed product development → mitigate by protecting critical roadmap items and reprioritizing features
