1) Quick math check (assumptions)
- Cash on hand: $1,200,000
- Stated burn rate: $62,000 / month (I’ll assume this is net cash burn = cash outflows minus cash inflows)
- Runway = cash / monthly burn = 1,200,000 / 62,000 = 19.35 months (≈ 19.4 months). Your “20 months” figure is consistent when rounded.

