- If you execute a 20% total cost reduction (mix of the above) → burn → 49.6K/month → runway ≈ 24.2 months. Add a $700K bridge → total cash 1.9M → runway = 1.9M / 49.6K ≈ 38.3 months. This is illustrative — exact numbers depend on actual cost composition and raise size.

