8) Risks & tradeoffs
- Cuts to R&D or sales too deep will stunt growth and reduce future revenue — prioritize cuts that minimally impact growth (SaaS audit, contractor spend, discretionary).
- Workforce reductions damage morale and institutional knowledge — only do targeted reductions with clear rationale and support.
- Debt increases financial covenants and interest costs — avoid over-leveraging.

9) Suggested next steps and deliverables I can prepare
