1) Immediate actions (0–60 days): hiring freeze, pause low-ROI marketing, vendor consolidation, and tightened collections — expected to reduce monthly net burn by ~10–20% and improve cash flow.
2) Structural actions (30–90 days): role rebalancing and office/SaaS rationalization to capture additional recurring savings if needed.
