- Discretionary spend pause (events, non-essential marketing): $5k–$20k / month
- Cloud & infrastructure optimization (rightsizing, reserved instances): $3k–$15k / month
- Office & travel reductions (more remote days, reduce meeting travel): $2k–$10k / month
