- Vendor renegotiation / extended payment terms: immediate cash flow benefit, reduces monthly cash outflow by $5k–$25k
- Marketing re-prioritization to highest ROI channels only: $5k–$30k / month
C. Medium-term / 3–6 months (structural)
- Headcount reductions / role eliminations (if necessary): large one-time impact + ongoing savings; a single manager-level role could save $8k–$15k/month, a team more.
