Revenue / cash acceleration (fast, non-dilutive)
- Accelerate collections / tighten payment terms: convert receivables to cash earlier ($10k–$100k one-time depending on AR).
- Negotiate customer prepayments / rollover deals (discount for upfront payment): one-time cash and improved visibility.
- Upsell / packaging to existing customers (higher margin, quicker close): $5k–$50k+/mo depending on sales capacity.
