Weeks 6–12 (Leadership)
- Implement structural cost reductions where needed (reorg / contractor cuts). Target: reach chosen burn reduction (e.g., 20%).
- Finalize short-term financing if runway still insufficient (bridge or debt). Target: secure cushion for next 12–18 months.
- Present updated plan to board with scenario modeling and KPIs.

