E. Fundraising options — pros/cons & timing
- Bridge note / SAFE: fast (2–6 weeks), lower process overhead, dilutive later.
- Priced round: takes 2–4+ months, better terms for investors, larger checks possible.
- Venture debt: 4–8 weeks if eligible (you need revenue/terms), less dilution but requires covenants.
- Revenue-based financing: quick, predictable repayments tied to revenue.
