3. Decide target runway (18 / 24 / 36 months) and fundraising tolerance (how much dilution acceptable).
4. I’ll draft:
   - A 1-page board memo with scenarios and ask OR
   - A 5–7 slide deck summarizing position, plan, scenarios, and ask.

Which deliverable do you want first (board memo or slide deck)? Also please confirm the assumption about burn being net of revenue and whether revenue is recurring — I’ll then build precise savings estimates and an exact scenario model.

