2) Runway scenarios (how many months with different actions)
Base case:
- Burn = $62,000 → runway ≈ 19.4 months

If you reduce monthly burn by:
- 10% (save $6,200 → burn $55,800) → runway = 1,200,000 / 55,800 = 21.5 months (+2.1 months)
- 20% (save $12,400 → burn $49,600) → runway = 24.2 months (+4.8 months)
