- “Balanced” plan (light plan + contractor reductions + some headcount repositioning): ~25% burn reduction → burn ≈ $46.5k → runway ≈ 25.8 months.
- “Aggressive” plan (balanced + targeted layoffs + office cuts): ~40–50% reduction → runway ~27–38 months depending on exact savings.

