- Breakdown of monthly burn by category (payroll, marketing, R&D, G&A, rent, vendors).
- Headcount (#FTEs and average fully-loaded monthly cost).
- How much of last quarter’s $670K is recurring vs one-time?
- Target runway you want to present (24 months? 36?).
- Appetite for layoffs vs. preference for fundraising.

10) Offer / next step
